    buf = buf + " * the FIRST MIXED-ABI leaf — an INTEGER-class `const char*` param (rdi/GP) with an\n"
    buf = buf + " * SSE-class `double` return (xmm0), exercising the per-arg/per-return SSE classifier\n"
    buf = buf + " * (_cabi_sse_arg(0)=false → string GP; _cabi_sse_ret=true → xmm0). The native body is\n"
    buf = buf + " * stdlib/runtime/hxlcl_core.hexa::hxlcl_atof (Route C, whitelisted in _is_cabi/\n"
    buf = buf + " * _cabi_is_fp): a 1:1 port of the frozen 0-libc floor #else parse (lenient ws+sign+\n"
    buf = buf + " * int+.frac+eE = musl atof=strtod(s,0) on the finite-decimal domain), self-contained\n"
    buf = buf + " * (no syscall, no errno, no inner C-ABI callee, no extern-data). Under\n"
    buf = buf + " * HEXA_RT_NATIVE_ATOF=1 (x86_64-linux gate in tool/stage_resolve_runtime_a) the shim\n"
