    buf = buf + " * x86_64-linux emit target the live leg is `__hx_syscall6(2, path, flags, mode, …)`\n"
    buf = buf + " * (__NR_open) + a negative-result errno store via `bl __errno_location` (glibc-provided,\n"
    buf = buf + " * resolved at link — the same errno provider the libc-delegate shim already pulls; NO new\n"
    buf = buf + " * provider). The arm64 openat leg + darwin SYS_OPEN leg are DCE'd out under\n"
    buf = buf + " * target_is_x86_64. objcopy isolates ONLY hxlcl_open_sys; its `bl __errno_location` is an\n"
    buf = buf + " * undefined external resolved by libc. Under HEXA_RT_NATIVE_OPEN_SYS=1 (x86_64-linux gate\n"
    buf = buf + " * in tool/stage_resolve_runtime_a) the shim drops open_sys (#ifndef below). DEFAULT\n"
    buf = buf + " * (unset) keeps this libc delegate → shim.o + archive byte-identical.\n"
    buf = buf + " * NOTE (FILE* coupled-leaf): hxlcl_fopen's native body bl's into hxlcl_open_sys; when\n"
