    buf = buf + " * [64]/_pids[64]/_init_done` (self/runtime_emit_full.hexa:3018-3050), so the composite no\n"
    buf = buf + " * longer cascades into pulling frozen statics (the M6-r2 concern flagged in the header comment\n"
    buf = buf + " * above is RESOLVED — the helpers hxlcl_popen_remember/forget/child_exit_nr are emitted as\n"
